# CQ-07 in SAREF Core + 4ENER + 4BLDG -- PARTIAL.
# The extensions supply the storage capability Core lacked (s4ener:Storage, and
# the s4ener RoleType individual EnergyStorage), and availability comes from
# Core's saref:hasState. What is still missing is the ACTOR: neither extension
# adds an agent class, and s4ener:hasRole has domain saref:Device, so "of actor
# X" cannot be applied. This returns every available storage device.
PREFIX saref:  <https://saref.etsi.org/core/>
PREFIX s4ener: <https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ener/>
SELECT ?asset WHERE {
  ?asset a s4ener:Storage ;
         saref:hasState <https://w3id.org/shift/kg/state/Online> .
}
ORDER BY ?asset
